## 11. Troubleshooting

| Issue | Cause | Solution |
|---|---|---|
| Connector doesn't render | Missing socket IDs in `plugMap` | Ensure `elementId` and `socketId` reference valid icon sockets |
| Diagonal line unexpected | `middlePointList` is empty | This is correct and standard for hierarchy connectors; add breakpoints only if orthogonal routing is needed |
| Icon color wrong | Incorrect `importance` value | Use correct level: `objective`, `highest`, `high`, `normal`, `low` |
| uuCommand not yellow | Importance not set to `highest` | uuCommand icons must always be `highest` |
| Labels overlap icons | `textWidth` too small or icon spacing insufficient | Increase `textWidth` or spacing between icons |
| Block behind icons | Wrong z-order | Blocks must be first in `elementZOrderList` |
| Annotation pointer missing | `pointerStart.positionOnAnnotation` is empty | Add sides array like `["bottom", "left", "top", "right"]` |
| Wrong line style | Not using preset helper | Use `connectSkip()` for dashed, `connectAssociation()` for solid |
| Diamond not appearing | Wrong relationType | Use `association1`, `aggregation1`, or `composition1` for proper pointers |
| Annotation not pointing correctly | Wrong `pointerSide` value | Use `'top'`, `'right'`, `'bottom'`, or `'left'` |
| Floating annotation has pointer | Used `addAnnotation()` instead of `addFloatingAnnotation()` | Use `addFloatingAnnotation()` for notes without pointers |